WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.772 --> 00:00:05.794
From the beginning of time, a rock had sat high on top of a mountain.

2
00:00:06.535 --> 00:00:16.859
The sun, the moon, Heaven, and Earth all worked their magic on the rock.

3
00:00:29.464 --> 00:00:30.885
day the rock split open.

4
00:00:33.787 --> 00:00:35.348
Inside was a monkey.

5
00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:40.851
The monkey stood up and stretched.

6
00:00:45.334 --> 00:00:47.955
Suddenly powerful light shot from his eyes.

7
00:00:52.378 --> 00:00:55.420
For a moment the light reached the Cloud Palace in Heaven.

8
00:00:57.364 --> 00:00:59.785
The Jade Emperor, ruler of Heaven, sat up.

9
00:01:00.886 --> 00:01:03.867
He turned to one of his captains, who was standing nearby.

10
00:01:03.887 --> 00:01:08.129
"Find out what caused that light," said the emperor.

11
00:01:08.149 --> 00:01:10.890
"Yes, Your Majesty," said the captain.

12
00:01:13.191 --> 00:01:14.791
The captain rushed out of the hall.

13
00:01:17.052 --> 00:01:20.774
He looked out the southern gate of Heaven and saw the monkey on Earth below.

14
00:01:22.334 --> 00:01:23.115
light was gone.

15
00:01:23.995 --> 00:01:26.808
But the captain had magical sight.

16
00:01:26.868 --> 00:01:28.969
He could see everything that had just happened.

17
00:01:28.989 --> 00:01:32.250
"Interesting," said the captain.

18
00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:38.153
"Well?" said the Jade Emperor when the captain returned.

19
00:01:38.173 --> 00:01:40.034
"What caused the light?"

20
00:01:40.054 --> 00:01:43.515
"It was a monkey," said the captain.

21
00:01:43.535 --> 00:01:45.316
"A monkey?"

22
00:01:45.776 --> 00:01:46.797
asked the Jade Emperor.

23
00:01:46.817 --> 00:01:49.077
"Yes," said the captain.

24
00:01:49.097 --> 00:01:52.099
"He's on the Fruit and Flower Mountain, down on Earth.

25
00:01:53.439 --> 00:01:54.760
had been a rock on the mountain.

26
00:01:56.512 --> 00:01:57.974
The monkey came from the rock.

27
00:01:58.755 --> 00:02:00.577
The light shone from the monkey's eyes."

28
00:02:03.681 --> 00:02:06.184
The emperor thought for a moment and then shrugged.

29
00:02:06.204 --> 00:02:09.749
"I'm not surprised," he said.

30
00:02:09.769 --> 00:02:14.054
"Amazing things happen when Heaven and Earth work together."

31
00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:31.943
As time passed, Monkey learned to walk, run, and climb.

32
00:02:35.305 --> 00:02:37.987
He drank from streams and ate grasses and leaves.

33
00:02:40.889 --> 00:02:43.972
He gathered fruit and explored caves and mountaintops.

34
00:02:49.155 --> 00:02:51.677
He became friends with all the other monkeys and apes.

35
00:02:53.678 --> 00:02:55.760
At night he slept under a cliff.

36
00:02:57.592 --> 00:03:01.955
One very hot morning, all the monkeys and apes were playing in the shade.

37
00:03:03.876 --> 00:03:05.617
is so hot today!"

38
00:03:05.918 --> 00:03:06.918
cried one monkey.

39
00:03:06.938 --> 00:03:10.060
"Let's play in the stream."

40
00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:11.782
"Good idea!"

41
00:03:12.102 --> 00:03:12.982
said another monkey.

42
00:03:13.803 --> 00:03:15.744
The monkeys and apes ran to the stream.

43
00:03:16.745 --> 00:03:18.946
The water rolled and bounced over the rocks.

44
00:03:21.488 --> 00:03:23.369
monkeys jumped into the cool water.

45
00:03:25.751 --> 00:03:28.476
Everyone splashed and played.

46
00:03:28.536 --> 00:03:31.257
After a few minutes, one monkey scratched her head.

47
00:03:32.677 --> 00:03:34.898
all love this stream," she said.

48
00:03:34.918 --> 00:03:37.078
"We drink from it.

49
00:03:37.799 --> 00:03:38.299
swim in it.

50
00:03:38.919 --> 00:03:41.500
We know that it flows all the way to the ocean.

51
00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:45.221
But does anyone know where the stream begins?"

52
00:03:46.381 --> 00:03:48.721
They all looked at one another and shook their heads.

53
00:03:48.741 --> 00:03:54.123
"We have nothing to do today," the monkey continued.

54
00:03:54.143 --> 00:03:57.844
"Why don't we follow the stream to find its source?"

55
00:03:59.144 --> 00:04:01.486
"That sounds like fun," said another monkey.

56
00:04:01.506 --> 00:04:03.127
"Let's go!"

57
00:04:03.467 --> 00:04:04.548
said a third monkey.

58
00:04:05.509 --> 00:04:07.050
Everyone jumped out of the water.

59
00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:11.593
They ran alongside the stream and swung from tree to tree.

60
00:04:12.533 --> 00:04:15.476
They jumped over rocks and climbed up steep cliffs.

61
00:04:16.656 --> 00:04:21.480
Higher and higher they went up the mountain until they reached an enormous waterfall.

62
00:04:22.881 --> 00:04:23.681
filled the air.

63
00:04:24.482 --> 00:04:30.492
The water crashed down, roaring like thunder.

64
00:04:30.552 --> 00:04:33.453
"I wonder what's behind that waterfall," said one monkey.

65
00:04:34.793 --> 00:04:36.534
too," said a second monkey.

66
00:04:36.554 --> 00:04:39.015
"But nobody could jump through it."

67
00:04:39.095 --> 00:04:44.356
"Whoever can jump through and come back alive will be our king," said a gibbon.

68
00:04:44.376 --> 00:04:46.837
"Is anyone brave enough to try?"

69
00:04:48.137 --> 00:04:50.078
the monkeys and apes looked at one another.

70
00:04:51.018 --> 00:04:52.038
They shook their heads.

71
00:04:53.559 --> 00:04:57.940
"I'm not going to try," said a tall monkey.

72
00:05:00.324 --> 00:05:02.346
"Me neither," said a short monkey.

73
00:05:03.386 --> 00:05:05.408
A voice called out, "I'll do it!"

74
00:05:06.509 --> 00:05:09.831
Everyone moved out of the way as the speaker stepped forward.

75
00:05:11.092 --> 00:05:11.973
It was Monkey.

76
00:05:13.454 --> 00:05:14.014
you sure?"

77
00:05:14.334 --> 00:05:14.895
asked the gibbon.

78
00:05:14.915 --> 00:05:17.537
"It looks dangerous."

79
00:05:17.637 --> 00:05:18.477
Monkey laughed.

80
00:05:18.497 --> 00:05:20.739
"I'm not afraid of anything!

81
00:05:21.419 --> 00:05:23.401
And when I come back, I will be king!"

82
00:05:24.301 --> 00:05:27.504
Monkey took a deep breath and leaped into the waterfall.
